# NovaiOS welcome banner shown on first login to TTY 1.

Welcome to NovaiOS 0.1 (live)
================================

  • Desktop session should auto-start on tty1
  • If the GUI does not appear, switch to tty2 with Ctrl+Alt+F2 and run:
        /usr/bin/novai-comp &
        /usr/bin/novai-panel &
  • To open the store, run:        novai-launcher --store
  • To install a package:          novai-pkg install <name>
  • To list installed packages:    novai-pkg list
  • Settings GUI:                  novai-settings
  • Documentation:                 https://github.com/salom600/NovaiOS

Default user:  novai   (no password; sudo with NOPASSWD)
Root password: not set

Have fun.
